---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="eyebrow">Personal engineering log · v0.1</div>
      <h1>你好，我是 lilyeggy。</h1>
      <p>我在这里记录项目、实验和每天的进步。这里不是一份静态简历，而是一个持续更新的工程现场。</p>
      <div class="terminal-line"><span>lilyeggy@localhost:~$</span> cat now.txt</div>
      <div class="now"><span class="pulse"></span><strong>现在正在做：</strong> 让 Agent 在真实项目里更可靠地工作。</div>
    </section>
    <section class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">01 / selected work</span><span class="line"></span></section>
    <section class="grid">
      <a class="card project-card" href="/projects/vram-aware-harness">
        <div class="project-top"><span class="project-icon">⌘</span><span class="tag">ACTIVE / CORE PROJECT</span></div>
        <h2>VRAM-Aware<br /><em>Agent Harness</em></h2>
        <p>支持团队共享本地大模型的多租户 Agent 任务服务，关注可靠执行、GPU 调度、工具治理与真实隔离。</p>
        <div class="stack"><span>TypeScript</span><span>Pi</span><span>vLLM</span><span>SQLite</span></div>
        <span class="arrow">查看项目 →</span>
      </a>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="tag">// DAILY LOG</span>
        <h2>每日进度</h2>
        <p>今天做了什么、遇到什么问题、下一步准备验证什么。把过程留下来，方便未来的自己回看。</p>
        <div class="log-preview"><span>2025.09.01</span> 网站视觉升级<br /><span>next</span> 加入更多项目日志</div>
        <span class="arrow">即将更新 →</span>
      </article>
      <article class="card contributions">
        <span class="tag">GitHub activity</span>
        <h2>提交记录</h2>
        <p class="stats"><b>lilyeggy</b> · 每一个绿色方块，都是一次微小的推进。</p>
        <img src="https://ghchart.rshah.org/68f3b0/lilyeggy" alt="lilyeggy's GitHub contribution graph" loading="lazy" />
      </article>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
